<title>JAPAN: Fuji Heavy sees 1997 car output up 10.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Fuji Heavy sees 1997 car output up 10.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd said on Thursday it expects its car output in calendar 1997 to be 460,000 units, up 10.3 percent from the previous year.  </p>
<p>Fuji Heavy also said it expected its car sales in Japan and abroad in 1997 to be 460,000 units, up 7.2 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>Details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
